{"id":"0d06c9b2e31fdbe6","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-assignment-idempotent.md","title":"Assignment Idempotency","display":"thm-assignment-idempotent — Assignment Idempotency","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-assignment-idempotent","aliases":["57-thm-assignment-idempotent"],"display":"thm-assignment-idempotent — Assignment Idempotency","depends_on":["[[57-df-assignment]]","[[57-df-modified-assignment]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-assignment-idempotent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-assignment-idempotent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-assignment-idempotent — Assignment Idempotency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"549899f7f232c7be\" href=\"?note=549899f7f232c7be\" title=\"57-df-modified-assignment\">57-df-modified-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{x,a}\">\\(U_{x,a}\\)</span> 及其迭代在下面定义；原迭代写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta[a/x])^n[a/x]\">\\((\\beta[a/x])^n[a/x]\\)</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次修改后的兼容记号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_{x,a}:\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\to\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A),\\qquad U_{x,a}(\\beta)\\coloneqq\\beta[a/x].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_{x,a}:\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\to\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A),\\qquad U_{x,a}(\\beta)\\coloneqq\\beta[a/x].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_{x,a}^{0}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id},\\qquad U_{x,a}^{n+1}\\coloneqq U_{x,a}\\circ U_{x,a}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_{x,a}^{0}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id},\\qquad U_{x,a}^{n+1}\\coloneqq U_{x,a}\\circ U_{x,a}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\beta[a/x])^n[a/x]\\coloneqq U_{x,a}^{n}(\\beta)\\quad(n\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\beta[a/x])^n[a/x]\\coloneqq U_{x,a}^{n}(\\beta)\\quad(n\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\ge1\\quad U_{x,a}^{n}(\\beta)=\\beta[a/x].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\ge1\\quad U_{x,a}^{n}(\\beta)=\\beta[a/x].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>迭代次数及其递归基例在正文确定；不再把没有定义的函数幂写法作为证明目标。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-modified-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"549899f7f232c7be","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-modified-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"U_{x,a}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\beta[a/x])^n[a/x]","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"U_{x,a}:\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\to\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A),\\qquad U_{x,a}(\\beta)\\coloneqq\\beta[a/x].","display":true},{"tex":"U_{x,a}^{0}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id},\\qquad U_{x,a}^{n+1}\\coloneqq U_{x,a}\\circ U_{x,a}^{n}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\beta[a/x])^n[a/x]\\coloneqq U_{x,a}^{n}(\\beta)\\quad(n\\ge1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\ge1\\quad U_{x,a}^{n}(\\beta)=\\beta[a/x].","display":true}],"bytes":1114,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-downward-LS]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness]]\n[[57-thm-TP-monotone]]\n[[57-thm-acf-decidable]]\n[[57-thm-a